Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: silent console by default

Every character costs ~87 us at 115200 baud once the UART FIFO is full, and
nobody is listening on this handheld's serial port. 'setenv silent' from the
console brings it back.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board policy]
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/board/sunxi/sunxi.env
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+silent=1
